    "body": "This would mean that `shadowRoot.stylesheets` would not include a stylesheet when the shadow root is disconnected from a document.  That doesn't reflect what we discussed in https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/56.\n\nIt looks like we need a separate bug for CSS OM as well: https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#extensions-to-the-document-interface\n",
